(We refer to Section~\ref{sec:prelims} for the definition of ends of digraphs.)

As a major step in the proof of Theorem~\ref{thm:main:intro:ReductionToOneEnd:doubleRays}, we verify Problem~\ref{prob:ubiquity:doubleRays} for a large, but technical, class of digraphs, see Theorem~\ref{thm:ubiquity:doubleRays}.

