\end{equation}
Consequently, under the assumption of shallow-water viscosity ($\mu(\rho)=\rho, \lambda(\rho)=0$) and the specific capillarity coefficient $\kappa(\rho)=1/\rho$, equation \eqref{NSK} can be rewritten as
